==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[THE FOLIVOREAN]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*5 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn once 60 Cat Units have been defeated, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn once 120 Cat Units have been defeated, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is recommended to rush down THE FOLIVOREAN by luring it near the base, then using high effective DPS units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] before the Ragin' Gories spawn, so that clearing them up would be easier.

